                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I ordered garlic chicken breast stir-fried with garlic and spaghetti with chili powder.\nDelicious!\n\nThere was too much pasta. Next time I\u0027ll have less pasta and more vegetables. They have a good variety of vegetables, including root vegetables.\n\nThe owner is very nice. There\u0027s a heater inside, and they provide a cup of warm water. You can also accumulate points. I\u0027ll definitely visit again next time I\u0027m in the area.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "點了蒜香雞胸蒜炒義大利麵加辣（辣粉）\n好吃！\n麵太多了下次要改麵少換菜\n菜的種類蠻多的也有根莖類\n\n老闆娘人很好～內用還有暖爐，會附上一杯溫水，還可以累積點數，下次有經過會再訪。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
